; Orchestrate meta signal — the privileged configuration wire contract.
;
; The connection carries signal's exchange layer. A peer greets once,
; settling this contract by the digest of this file; after that every
; query opens an exchange the peer names, is answered with exactly one
; frame on that exchange, and the exchange then ends. Nothing here
; streams.
;
; Refused.Store answers an input the Nexus store could not carry out, a
; commit that failed among them, with the store's own words; the Refusal
; is the ordinary contract's own.
Signal
[ signal_orchestrate:[ OrchestrateNexusConfiguration ConfigurationReceipt Refusal ] ]
[ Configure.OrchestrateNexusConfiguration ReverseMetaConfiguration ]
[ Configured.ConfigurationReceipt OrdinaryConfigurationReopened.ConfigurationReceipt
  ConfigurationRejected.ConfigurationRejection PeerRefused.PeerRejection Refused.Refusal ]
[ ConfigurationRejectionReason.[ InvalidConfiguration ]
  ConfigurationRejection.{ ConfigurationRejectionReason }
  PeerUserId.Integer
  PeerRejection.{ PeerUserId } ]
